
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7fb;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .icon {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background-color: #e6f7ec;
            color: #17a34a;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .title {
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: #222;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666;
        }

        .success-box {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f0faf3;
            border: 1px solid #d5f0dd;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #17a34a;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .warning {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #999;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="icon">
            &#10003;
        </div>

        <h2 class="title">
            Password Reset Successful
        </h2>

        <p class="message">
            Hello <%= name %>,
        </p>

        <p class="message">
            Your password has been changed successfully.
            You can now log in to your PH Healthcare System account
            using your new password.
        </p>

        <div class="success-box">
            Your password has been successfully updated.
        </div>

        <p class="warning">
            If you did not make this change, please contact our
            support team immediately.
        </p>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

